  "repeatable": false,
  "flavor": "A watercolor world of wonder, where trees wear leaves like emeralds and wildflowers bloom in every color of the rainbow. The sweet scent of honey and blooming heather fills the air, as the soft chirping of birds provides a soothing background melody."
